2.17 Expected Outputs
The project was expected to achieve:
•	Fifty-one (51) healthy market-ready improved Kienyeji broilers.
•	Increased practical skills in poultry production.
•	Improved understanding of climate-smart livestock farming.
•	Accurate production and financial records.
•	Improved teamwork and leadership among students.
•	Income generation from the sale of poultry meat and manure.
•	Adoption of sustainable poultry production practices.
